, accurate fault detection, splice loss measurement, and fiber length verification up to 80 km, ensuring top network performance. Its intuitive 5-inch touchscreen and rugged design make it perfect for field technicians working on GPON, EPON, and long-haul fiber optic cables.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>High-resolution fault detection and characterization</li><li>Fast splice and connector loss measurement</li><li>Supports singlemode (1310/1550 nm) and multimode fiber testing</li><li>Intuitive 5-inch color touchscreen for easy operation</li><li>Rugged and lightweight design for field conditions</li><li>Long battery life for uninterrupted testing</li><li>Multi-wavelength testing capabilities</li><li>USB and Bluetooth for quick data transfer</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>Technical Specifications:</h3><ul><li><b>Wavelengths:</b> 1310 nm / 1550 nm (singlemode), optional 850/1300 nm (multimode)</li><li><b>Dynamic Range:</b> Up to 37 dB</li><li><b>Event Dead Zone: </b>≤ 1 m</li><li><b>Attenuation Dead Zone: </b>≤ 4 m</li><li><b>Maximum Test Range: </b>Up to 80 km (depending on fiber type and model)</li><li><b>Display:</b> 5-inch color touchscreen</li><li><b>Battery Life:</b> Up to 8 hours continuous use</li><li><b>Interfaces: </b>USB, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi (depending on model)</li><li><b>Dimensions:</b> Compact and portable for field use</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                           \n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-5 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\">\n                  <div class=\"